SUMMARY:Eid Stories
DESCRIPTION:Join us with your family at Ithra Library during Eid Al-Adha where we follow the storyteller&rsquo\;s attempts to show us why Eid at his home is truly special. Along the way\, we discover that Eid moves feelings and fills homes! We then continue with a fun interactive activity\, where we share our thoughts and write Eid messages\, expressing gratitude to our families and celebrating the special feelings Eid brings.
